<!-- NEW VERSION (09/02/2021) -->

<section id="jerry">
<h1 class="persona_title">Jerry is colour blind</h1>
<img src={Jerry.src} alt="" class="stretch" />
</section>

<section>
<h2>8% of all men are colour blind</h2>
<ul>
<li>They can see colours: they don't have monochrome vision.</li>
<li>They may have limited ability to distinguish between two colours, such as red and green.</li>
<li>There are different types of colour blindness</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section>
<p>Jerry cannot tell red and green apart </p>
<img class="stretch" src="https://images.anysurfer.be/gijs/74.jpg" alt="Ishihara test, number 74 in green on red/orange background, invisible for some colorblind people" />
</section>

<section>
<img class="stretch" src="https://images.anysurfer.be/gijs/74-after.jpg" alt="same image but only the number 74 without the red background" />
</section>

<section>
<img class="stretch" src="https://images.anysurfer.be/gijs/21.jpg" alt="Same image with 74 and background all in same brownish color, 74 not visible" />
</section> 

<section>	
<blockquote><p>"I hated playing UNO as a child."</p></blockquote>
</section>

<section>
<p><img class="stretch" src="https://images.anysurfer.be/gijs/uno-original.jpg" alt="4 UNO cards : red, green, yellow and blue" /></p>
</section>

<section>
<img src="https://images.anysurfer.be/gijs/uno-colorblind.jpg" alt="UNO cards with extra symbol indicating the color" />
</section>

